WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:06.480
Your Highness, we have a 
Mont Blanc for your dessert today.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:08.820
A Mont Blanc!

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.190
You told me you liked chestnuts before, so...

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.650
I hope you enjoy it.

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:16.540
Thank you very much.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:17.780
I'll have some.

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:26.030
It's really good, Mullin!

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.740
<i>Now she's doing all of her 
work without complaining.</i>

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:41.220
<i>She's unstoppable after
she's had chestnuts.</i>

00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:47.190
I wish I could go pick all the walnuts 
back in the ancient times again...

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:56.880
We're back! The first demon, Beelzebub!

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.880
We're back!
The first demon,
<b>Beelzebub!</b>

00:00:56.880 --> 00:00:58.970
Drum, drum, drum! Yay!

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:00.950
Drum, drum, drum! Yay!

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:53.400
You made these madeleines, Belphegor?

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:53.400
Yes, I made a bunch of them, 
so have them, if you'd like.

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:57.900
I mean, I really made 
them just for you, but...

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:00.380
I have jam.

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:01.740
I have jam, too!

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:04.360
Thank you.
Can I eat them now?

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:07.240
Of course.

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:09.710
Thanks.

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:27.600
Another dream...

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:33.270
<b>Gocchin in Merryland.</b>

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:36.840
Actually, I had no trouble talking to him,

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:39.820
so even I kind of realized it wasn't real!

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:41.700
It was just too good to be true!

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:44.800
Good morning, Belphegor-sama.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:47.280
Good morning, Caim-san.

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:50.490
I have our itinerary for today.

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:52.820
After we do some desk work in your office,

00:03:52.820 --> 00:03:56.630
we will head to Her Highness 
Beelzebub's office at 11.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:01.470
After lunch, we have a meeting for the 
European division starting at 1:30,

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:05.450
and from 3:00 to 6:00, 
you have nothing scheduled.

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:06.990
Understood.

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:09.180
Thank you for everything, Caim-san.

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:10.620
No problem.

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:15.770
Your bed is quite in disarray.

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:23.110
Did you get upset after another
dream about Azazel-sama?

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:24.960
I'm so sorry!

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.820
You didn't have to say that! 
That's so embarrassing!

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:30.520
That's why you need to just 
tell him you like him already!

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:36.190
This old man is worried 
that you'll never get married!

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:40.300
I think most older men wouldn't want 
to give a girl away to someone else...

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:45.380
I think you need to at 
least talk to Azazel-sama.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:48.720
Otherwise, you're not even going 
to be able to get closer to him.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:53.020
But I get so nervous, I have 
to go to the bathroom...

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:58.720
Then convey to him that it's difficult for 
you to talk due to your urges to urinate...

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:03.030
I would die from embarrassment
if I told him that!

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.950
Well, I don't know what to do, then.

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.780
I, most of all, don't know what to do.

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:19.460
<i>If it had taken me ten seconds longer to wake up,</i>

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:22.680
<i>Azazel-sama would have eaten my madeleines.</i>

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:26.400
<i>I wanted to be with him a bit longer,</i>

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:28.750
<i>even if it was just in my dreams.</i>

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:34.000
There will be quite a few 
angels attending our

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:38.510
next regular summit with 
Heaven stationed in France,

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:41.980
so I'd like to request a 
good deal of your help.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:46.040
I've put together some documents 
I'd like your opinion on.

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.570
I'll go get them now.

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:48.730
Okay...

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:53.480
Gocchin?

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:56.210
Is something the matter?

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.750
You seem kind of down today.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:05:59.560
Huh?

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:03.280
No, I'm fine.

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:07.220
But... I had a dream about Azazel-sama...

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:09.920
Isn't that good?

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:12.150
Why do you seem so disappointed?

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:14.860
Huh? Oh, yeah. That's a good point.

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:17.060
Better than not having any.

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:18.980
Sorry for the wait.

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:21.080
Please take a look.

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:22.980
Yeah, thanks.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.000
Okay, Bell, see you later today.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:25.660
Sure.

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:30.710
I mean, I should be glad that
I had a dream about Azazel-sama.

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:32.980
I'm silly for wanting more.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:33.910
Huh?

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.120
Beelzebub, there's something 
I'd like to check with you.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:42.040
Bathroom!

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:42.040
<b>Bathroom</b>

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:46.350
I can talk to him when I'm dreaming,

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:48.280
so why do I have to go pee now?!

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:51.510
I'm so dumb! Dumb! Dumb! Dumb!

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:56.520
<i>Gocchin's nervous urges to pee
have been acting up again as of late.</i>

00:06:56.520 --> 00:07:02.350
Sorry, were you done with Belphegor?

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:01.680
It's okay. She was about to leave.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:03.730
I see.

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:09.610
I ended up scaring her again.

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:13.820
I guess I have a pretty scary face...

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:13.360
Bro...

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:18.180
Hey, Azazel, do you have a 
lot of work this afternoon?

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.480
I'm having tea at the botanical garden.

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:24.370
Would you like to come along, as well?

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:29.460
It'll just be Adrammelech, Belphegor, and us, 
in a rather laid-back atmosphere.

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:41.020
Maybe next time...
Today is a bit hectic.

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:42.580
I see.

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:45.180
Well, next time, then.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.730
Thanks.

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:57.610
<i>I'd feel bad if I frightened Belphegor 
the whole time during her fun teatime.</i>

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:22.060
So cute!

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:26.100
So cute

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:26.390
They're the teatime one-piece from Alice.

00:08:26.390 --> 00:08:28.440
Having the right atmosphere 
at these things is important.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.280
I'm so glad I made these.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:33.900
I'm not 100% sure about this,

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:36.740
but wasn't the one-piece dress in Alice blue?

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:41.680
I was inspired by the yellow that Tenniel 
first drew for Belphegor-chan's dress,

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:45.500
and Her Highness' flower design 
from Rackham's book illustrations.

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:48.860
But then Gertrude had to go 
and make her dress pure white,

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:52.160
and McManus gave her a deep red 
dress and changed her hair.

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:53.470
Only then, when we come to Robinson...

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:12.770
U-Um...

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:16.170
I-I'm not sure I should be here.

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:18.930
I feel bad for interrupting your "girl time."

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:21.590
It's not a problem for men to be here.

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:22.830
That's right.

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:25.580
A teatime is where gentlemen and 
ladies commune in proper society.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:26.420
That's correct.

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:27.900
Oh, yeah,

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:31.380
the two of you were with Her Highness 
and us the other day, weren't you?

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:35.630
I didn't have time to wonder who 
they were at the time, though...

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:41.040
This is Morrigan, the Succubus Section 
Chief for the Seduction Department.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:43.020
<b>Seduction Department,
Succubus Section Chief
Morrigan</b>

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:43.020
Nice to meet you.

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:44.670
The Succubus Section?!

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:50.130
<i>The Succubus Section appeals 
to humans with lust,</i>

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:53.770
<i>and any male demon would 
love to be with them!</i>

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:55.580
Nice to meet you, Mullin-kun.

00:09:55.580 --> 00:09:57.080
Y-Yeah!

00:09:57.080 --> 00:10:00.310
I'm the assistant to Belphegor-sama.

00:10:00.310 --> 00:10:01.700
My name's Caim.

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:03.580
Nice to meet you.

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:06.490
Wait a second...

00:10:06.490 --> 00:10:07.840
Well, maybe this makes sense.

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:09.700
I assume you have assistants, 
too, Adrammelech-san?

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:13.380
I have good-looking guys just for me.

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:17.260
Good-looking guys just for you...

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:19.110
And you, as well, Morrigan-san?

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:22.160
Yes, thirty-nine girls.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:25.470
They're also idols here in the 
underworld entertainment sector.

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:29.650
You mean SCB39?!

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:32.320
You two are both amazing.

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:36.570
Your Highness, quite the fluffiness you have.

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:37.800
With Mullin.

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:38.810
I know, right?

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:40.780
Don't say that, Your Highness.

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:47.150
This is good!

00:10:47.150 --> 00:10:48.750
Mullin, this is good!

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:49.720
I'll give you half!

00:10:49.720 --> 00:10:51.820
O-Oh, thanks.

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:59.050
You're right, it is!

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:01.260
Well, this is a surprise.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:07.230
I wouldn't have expected Her Highness 
to speak with you so frankly.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:08.190
Huh?

00:11:08.190 --> 00:11:11.960
I guess you could say Her Highness was kept 
a bit too protected when she was younger...

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:14.800
Well, she grew up in a 
rather unique environment.

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.190
She did?

00:11:16.990 --> 00:11:21.660
<i>I guess that's why she sees things 
differently than most people would.</i>

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:24.060
But this is quite a surprise.

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:28.950
For her to speak so directly 
with a young boy...

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:32.140
Well, I am her assistant, 
so we do speak often.

00:11:32.140 --> 00:11:36.020
A long time ago, she wasn't even 
permitted to converse with men.

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:37.500
Really?

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:41.610
<i>I guess that's why she acts like 
a grade schooler in love, then.</i>

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:46.300
So you've known Her Highness since she was young?

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:53.490
Yes, because I've been serving 
Belphegor-sama ever since she was born,

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:57.350
and since Her Highness 
Beelzebub and Belphegor-sama

00:11:57.350 --> 00:11:59.280
have been friends since they were young,

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:02.160
I have observed the two 
of them the entire time.

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:03.800
I see.

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:08.520
But now I'm even more worried 
about Belphegor-sama.

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:12.550
At this rate, Her Highness Beelzebub 
is going to leave her behind.

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:15.580
<i>Her Highness also acts like an 
grade schooler in love,</i>

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.380
<i>so it'll probably be okay.</i>

00:12:26.690 --> 00:12:29.930
<i>I've gotten all hot
after all that talking.</i>

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:32.940
<i>I want something cold to drink.</i>

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:33.390
<i>Huh?</i>

00:12:34.050 --> 00:12:35.560
<i>It's grape juice!</i>

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:39.880
Huh? Gocchin?

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:44.010
Gocchin?

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:47.280
Oh, sorry.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:49.640
I was a bit thirsty.

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:55.960
Oh, yeah, I found a book I wanted 
to look at with you the other day.

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:59.680
I was thinking of bringing 
it today, but I forgot it.

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:01.090
What type of book was it?

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.100
A book on antique bears.

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:06.200
It has a bunch of stuffed bears 
from around the world in it.

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:08.130
That sounds fluffy!

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:10.310
Maybe the next time
we see each other again, then.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:13.770
Actually, maybe I'll get it now.

00:13:14.530 --> 00:13:15.830
Hold on a second.

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:16.770
Gocchin?

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:19.230
Belphegor-sama, I'll go.

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:21.120
No, it's fine.

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:22.770
I don't have to go far.

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:26.240
Uh, Adrammelech-san.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:27.150
What is it?

00:13:27.150 --> 00:13:29.760
I'd like to ask your advice on something.

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:30.660
Hm?

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:35.960
Is there some way we can dress Bro 
up so he doesn't scare Gocchin?

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.880
Huh? Why?

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:41.160
Gocchin's always scared of him,

00:13:41.160 --> 00:13:43.370
and he is really bothered by that.

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:47.920
So if we change his appearance 
somehow and make him less scary,

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:50.300
I was thinking that Gocchin wouldn't 
be so scared of him anymore.

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:52.970
My, my, my.

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:55.270
Are you serious right now?

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:56.270
Huh?

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.280
You should get a clue before 
everyone stops liking you.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:04.780
Want to receive a special 
lesson from my section?

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:08.080
Wh-Why are we talking about 
people not liking me?!

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:10.600
I'm just worried about Bro!

00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:12.240
I'm glad you're worried about someone else,

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:14.390
but you should worry about yourself, too.

00:14:14.390 --> 00:14:15.450
Huh?

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.920
Hey, did someone drink my wine?

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:20.000
Huh?

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.510
It wasn't me.

00:14:21.510 --> 00:14:23.380
I haven't drank any, either.

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:27.590
That's strange...

00:14:28.170 --> 00:14:30.150
Wait, this is a tea party,

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:32.130
so why would you even have wine here?

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:33.180
What's the problem?

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:34.190
It's elegant.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:43.320
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:45.180
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:47.280
<i>I'm getting kind of lightheaded.</i>

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:50.400
<i>I wonder if I'm catching a cold.</i>

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:53.240
<i>I'm all hot, too... 
It might be a fever.</i>

00:14:54.430 --> 00:14:56.090
<i>I should take a shortcut.</i>

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:10.990
<i>Huh? Belphegor...</i>

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:12.680
<i>You should be at your tea party...</i>

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:14.210
<i>Th-That's...!</i>

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:17.520
<i>Tenniel's version of the Alice one-piece.</i>

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:20.940
<i>Not surprising the Bro would 
pick up on that immediately.</i>

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:24.540
<i>That's pretty cute. 
The ends have pintucks in it.</i>

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:26.380
<i>I wonder what material her 
pannier are made out of.</i>

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:29.650
<i>Belphegor?!</i>

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:33.870
Are you okay!?

00:15:36.090 --> 00:15:37.140
<i>Her face is red.</i>

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:38.780
<i>I need to get her to the 
infirmary right away.</i>

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:39.560
<i>Wait.</i>

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:41.210
<i>It might be better not to move her.</i>

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:46.160
<i>Huh? What's wrong with me?</i>

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:48.710
<i>I feel light and really good.</i>

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:52.300
<i>Huh? Azazel-sama?</i>

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:54.640
<i>Why is Azazel-sama here?</i>

00:15:55.320 --> 00:15:59.350
<i>Oh, I bet this is another dream.</i>

00:16:01.150 --> 00:16:03.690
<i>Oh, I know! I should have Buer come here!</i>

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.690
<b>Infirmary Head Doctor
Buer</b>

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:06.860
<i>Hold on just a second, Belphegor!</i>

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:11.380
You can't...

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:13.140
You can't go...

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:17.730
<i>I get to have a dream of you 
and now you're trying to...</i>

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:20.620
<i>I don't know when I'll get 
to have another dream of you.</i>

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:23.980
<i>She... smells like alcohol.</i>

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:25.730
<i>Is she drunk?</i>

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:29.950
You can't! Don't!

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:42.600
<b>Ahhh</b>

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:44.500
Do you feel okay?

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:46.320
I feel good!

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:50.530
I think you should at least
drink some water... I'll get some.

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:50.530
No!

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:54.660
Azazel-sama, do you hate me?!

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:56.490
<i>That's not the problem...</i>

00:16:56.720 --> 00:16:58.790
Stay with me longer!

00:16:56.990 --> 00:17:02.450
<b>Squeeeze</b>

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:00.380
Until I wake up!

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:02.450
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.380
Have you calmed down some?

00:17:09.690 --> 00:17:11.650
I ish calms.

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:12.720
<i>"Calms"...</i>

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:15.960
I'm happy...

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:19.600
<i>I don't get nervous when I talk 
to Azazel-sama in my dreams.</i>

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:24.890
<i>Azazel-sama's so warm, even in my dreams.</i>

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:28.900
Belphegor...

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:33.020
You're not scared of me right now?

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:32.800
Why would I?

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:35.360
You always run away from me.
Because I'm scary.

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:37.340
That's not true at all!

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:40.080
<i>But you definitely avoid me.</i>

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:46.040
<i>Does your "that's not true at all" 
mean that you don't think I'm scary?</i>

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:49.850
<i>That you're not scared at all?</i>

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:55.430
<i>But every time I run into you...</i>

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:05.180
Belphegor, could I ask you something, then?
Why do you always...

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:08.900
<b>Zzzz...</b>

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:08.470
<i>She's asleep?!</i>

00:18:09.140 --> 00:18:12.740
<i>I wanted you to tell me why you 
run away before you fell asleep!</i>

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:22.020
<i>It's my first time seeing 
her face so up-close.</i>

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.760
<i>She's really petite,
now that I see her like this.</i>

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:32.510
<i>Beelzebub, too. I think 
you both should eat more.</i>

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:38.010
Should work
out more.

00:18:32.510 --> 00:18:34.740
<i>You look so fragile, 
like you're going to fall apart.</i>

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:38.010
<i>Bell eats a lot, and has 
the strength of a gorilla.</i>

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:40.900
Azazel-sama...

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:56.820
<i>I see.</i>

00:18:57.910 --> 00:18:59.610
<i>So she wasn't scared, then.</i>

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:02.740
<i>That makes me feel better.</i>

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:06.900
<i>I think we like the same things, too.</i>

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:13.380
<i>I hope we can become better friends.</i>

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:17.060
Oh?

00:19:17.060 --> 00:19:17.850
Oh, my.

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:22.010
Huh?

00:19:40.520 --> 00:19:41.680
<i>Belphegor.</i>

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:44.280
<i>Azazel-sama!</i>

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:45.690
<i>Wh-What should I do?</i>

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:47.230
<i>I don't really remember,</i>

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:50.760
<i>but Bell and the others said 
I got drunk and Azazel-sama carried me back.</i>

00:19:50.760 --> 00:19:55.170
<i>Also, I remember saying something 
really to rude him, too!</i>

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:57.630
Do you feel better now?

00:19:57.920 --> 00:20:01.220
<i>I need to use this chance to talk to him...</i>

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:03.040
<i>Oh, yeah!</i>

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:05.600
<i>Belphegor had passed out!</i>

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:06.470
<i>But right now she's...</i>

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:11.080
<i>Maybe I just assumed she wasn't 
scared of me when she really is.</i>

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.960
<i>If I try to act like we're closer,</i>

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:14.940
<i>she might even become more scared of me.</i>

00:20:16.180 --> 00:20:17.440
U-Um...

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:19.000
<i>Gotta play it cool.</i>

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:19.660
<i>Huh?</i>

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:25.780
<i>He... avoided me?</i>

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:29.440
Bell!

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:30.780
There, there.

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:31.980
There, there.

00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:36.330
<i>One step forward, two steps back.</i>

00:22:08.850 --> 00:22:14.080
We're back! The first demon, Beelzebub!

00:22:11.180 --> 00:22:16.270
We're back!
The first demon,
<b>Beelzebub!</b>

00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:16.270
Fruuuuuu!

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:22.830
I've gotten bored with nuts and shells.

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:20.690
<b>Earthenware</b>

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:22.190
<b>Earthenware
Earthenware</b>

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:21.690
<b>Knead</b>

00:22:21.730 --> 00:22:22.190
<b>Knead
Knead</b>

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:23.190
<b>Earthenware</b>

00:22:22.830 --> 00:22:25.190
I want to eat some meat.

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:25.190
<b>Earthenware
Earthenware</b>

00:22:23.690 --> 00:22:24.190
<b>Knead</b>

00:22:24.190 --> 00:22:25.190
<b>Knead
Knead</b>

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:29.160
Azazel got us a mammoth!

00:22:30.060 --> 00:22:31.470
Azazel-sama, you're so cool!

00:22:31.470 --> 00:22:32.800
Did you get that by yourself?

00:22:32.800 --> 00:22:33.810
So cool!

00:22:33.810 --> 00:22:35.120
Marry me!

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:39.580
<i>Shriek!</i>

00:22:36.240 --> 00:22:39.140
<i>The world ran on muscles back then.</i>

00:22:39.990 --> 00:22:43.870
Azazel, I'd like to trade 
your meat for some nuts.

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:44.920
Sure!

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:47.800
How many slices do you need?

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:51.510
How many slices do you need?
I was thinking of cooking some later.
Would you like to eat together?

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:58.390
We can cook some chestnuts 
and eat them with the steak.

00:22:53.490 --> 00:22:55.070
That sounds good.

00:22:55.070 --> 00:22:58.460
<i>They could make a "stone midden" 
instead of a shell midden!</i>

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:05.980
I feel bad for Gocchin 
since Azazel is so popular!

00:23:06.200 --> 00:23:07.920
Mullin, what should we—

00:23:09.750 --> 00:23:11.640
Bro, you're so cool!

00:23:11.640 --> 00:23:13.090
I wanna get a mammoth, too!

00:23:13.090 --> 00:23:14.250
Mullin!

00:23:13.090 --> 00:23:15.450
Bro! Bro! Mammoth! Mammoth!

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:21.820
Wow, you finished a lot 
earlier than scheduled.

00:23:21.820 --> 00:23:24.890
You really can focus!

00:23:24.890 --> 00:23:25.840
Mullin.

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:26.630
Yes?

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:32.390
<b>Tear...</b>

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:32.720
I don't like it when you care 
more about mammoths than me.

00:23:32.720 --> 00:23:33.530
What?!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Her Highness Knows Not Her Assistant's Heart.</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>The Name of That Feeling Is...</b>

00:23:36.110 --> 00:23:37.850
Look forward to next time.
